{"title":"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdc028050428615cc28ee3c1f9a67eda8e9a726c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> denote the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/183fdd96e440d7526512950f1ec491becf832db3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{k}$\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" />th powers of the roots of the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/84104f35f8b36d9b6fa04a1036b7e043f57ddfb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-5x^2+8x-13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />. In particular, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/c/6ecb76fbef48b875ffb5078a9c176fd378badac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_0=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d6db03b70676744f87cbc9784f33332e3e3d5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89df0e8b4236be93b4073587cec9546e27e0836f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de8341691d962887a08594c7f1fcbb6ffbcba780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{k+1} = a \\, s_k + b \\, s_{k-1} + c \\, s_{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789e7886ab2c8ab41ce25f01d6273c339aae4830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$....$\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" /> What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebd1e0356cfe09c0d9b5459d6f1542657bb5891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/c/a7c82d0be32ba32bea20d1e11e2f1dd5ecabee21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\; -6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\; 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\; 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\; 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\; 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"389\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Applying <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Newton&#39;s_Sums\">Newton's Sums</a>, we have<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab936b146c0392c59fa230195cfb6fa1ed6acb9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s_{k+1}+(-5)s_k+(8)s_{k-1}+(-13)s_{k-2}=0,\\]\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" />so<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8ebe1f551d4a709734eff0a8910b6a4344d15f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s_{k+1}=5s_k-8s_{k-1}+13s_{k-2},\\]\" width=\"226\" height=\"17\" />we get the answer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e6caa69e278f6cf8dbf21ff666c4ab8ff6daed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+(-8)+13=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f06a183d1092b27328c12a97322763ac8db97a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the roots of the polynomial. Then,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a2cfa1df9021f76fb72c132f05ce4691cd74dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^3 - 5p^2 + 8p - 13 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f7477e6658ea9b9a9af9f347c3d7ff030d87e34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q^3 - 5q^2 + 8q - 13 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/7/f17f3ae91735c179865a02fe6396685be6426de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3 - 5r^2 + 8r - 13 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"177\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Adding these three equations, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/886492f00cfb85467e2d007f99b8f7430b3d8c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p^3 + q^3 + r^3) - 5(p^2 + q^2 + r^2) + 8(p + q + r) - 39 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"436\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb9536f767769acc08f5ccbcc8856a3de72a3aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_3 - 5s_2 + 8s_1 = 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e058d401a1b942f106f081ff1fcca8a8b1d42a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/346cbb619eddaf8dd3e8065a47e1f08400b9f465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13s_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" />, giving\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/c/75cf19159c44b9cbabfa35193a1b805ecbbb3089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_3 = 5s_2 - 8s_1 + 13s_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"167\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de8341691d962887a08594c7f1fcbb6ffbcba780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{k+1} = a \\, s_k + b \\, s_{k-1} + c \\, s_{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" /> is satisfied for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789e7886ab2c8ab41ce25f01d6273c339aae4830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$....$\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" />, meaning it must be satisfied when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71c81b2ed74710e7a1ede3bf920084f306834a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_3 = a \\, s_2 + b \\, s_1 + c \\, s_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/9258dc5ff7fee8350b3305f1e0560237d63a59b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 5, b = -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9fd57b20f51bc00b2c081b47d8c97981e082e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> by matching coefficients.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ece061c84699364b3d30e921a68f1667d7be8fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 8 + 13 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"170\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f06a183d1092b27328c12a97322763ac8db97a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the roots of the polynomial. By Vieta's Formulae, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4e810881f140610dea3842e113f0eff01b66f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f31598cf004c8fd714bd87b0eea46d057a002bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq+qr+rp = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b8214f84638548830b2b5e29e1dbd6abfb5267.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pqr=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd2ffaea39122862e213d215c1c2e6fdd7c28c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_k = p^k + q^k + r^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />. Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/d/93d4dfc1d32898ed664dba23ccc6ec66d59abbc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q+r)(s_k) =5s_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d44a6f886a76b0dcc3d1cb868215ec4ce35cce40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5s_k = [p^{k+1} + q^{k+1} + r^{k+1}] + p^k q + p^k r + pq^k + q^k r + pr^k + qr^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"494\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02056e6635cb99269c6e5d00652a0d2f1f88cd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pqr = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a415d42dd1756342f5d4ff6d9c3b36d8c1b33ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{k-2} = p^{k-2} + q^{k-2} + r^{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"203\" height=\"19\" />, we see\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/d/1cd4c5e19402ab86534562e7ea81dce9b2c64256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13s_{k-2} = p^{k-1}qr + pq^{k-1}r + pqr^{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"274\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec0045970fd7e12f2c0cbbe6acafc3457d3aa4d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split} 5s_k + 13s_{k-2} &amp;= s_{k+1} + (p^k q + p^k r + p^{k-1}qr) + (pq^k + pq^{k-1}r + q^k r) + (pqr^{k-1} + pr^k + qr^k) \\\\ &amp;= s_{k+1} + p^{k-1} (pq + pr + qr) + q^{k-1} (pq + pr + qr) + r^{k-1} (pq + pr + qr) \\\\ &amp;= s_{k+1} + (p^{k-1} + q^{k-1} + r^{k-1})(pq + pr + qr) \\\\ &amp;= 5s_k + 13s_{k-2} = s_{k+1} + 8s_{k-1}\\end{split}\\]\" width=\"709\" height=\"101\" />\n</p><p>Rearrange to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a653b2fdf80b18ea4d77956b9f5029ac869f7195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{k+1} = 5s_k - 8s_{k-1} + 13s_{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d440f1d7562308404bc95161c663535f0e811bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+ b + c = 5 -8 + 13 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"264\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-gregwwl\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faa7e4dae453f67aa78269d730f7cae70296659a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,s,t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"38\" height=\"15\" /> be the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/84104f35f8b36d9b6fa04a1036b7e043f57ddfb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-5x^2+8x-13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7eead88f3d1be6957deb7e6f28065e105046e850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3=5r^2-8r+13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" /> \\\\\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e5f5976983ff82bc5f0c9a976b06b8bcd781acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^3=5s^2-8s+13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" /> \\\\\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/148fac3dbb5e4884b79cc3be48b492672a665b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^3=5t^2-8t+13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If we multiply both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcdc1537798e37cfc7e1ac90e2b0d36a1e31f55a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^k$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer, then that won't change the coefficients, but just the degree of the new polynomial and the other term's exponents. We can try multiplying to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/429749dd381e66df42eaed694b9d5d609bcd1590.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^4+s^4+t^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" />, but that is just to check. So then with the above information about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b84e820e988dc3452c71b81d4e3ed189382cc1d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3,s^3,t^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" />, we see that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/171268b45ad733c6a25de0b74262748f2b2044d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^k=5r^{k-1}-8r^{k-2}-13r^{k-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"225\" height=\"19\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/e/21e3487920ef6e595a51186eb783b843cc633d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^k=5s^{k-1}-8s^{k-2}-13s^{k-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"225\" height=\"19\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c791fce835d86c25efc339859b91e7b3bf702b7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^k=5t^{k-1}-8t^{k-2}-13t^{k-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"217\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/e/43e3e8f291fdfc214620c0f81215635649330df6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_k=r^k+s^k+t^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/4/c946e9125dae0dd2f60bb982610f790fbd0a3d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_k=5s_{k-1}-8s_{k-2}+13s_{k-3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/109e36d23764256f3341a8a1004889957f184a16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{k+1}=5s_{k}-8s_{k-1}+13s_{k-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" />, as expected. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b12cf79b626a30e1cf15b5dd2a8e282d76e12c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5, b=-8, c=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"18\" />. So our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/f/d0f79fdbee169a7938f6741992b7f3b46c5fd818.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-8+13=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"172\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-IzhanAli\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the roots be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />. We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3f73ffb28bd421386a736d029e47232d02aba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2+s^2+t^2 = (r+s+t)(r+s+t) - 2(rs+st+tr)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"419\" height=\"21\" />.Continuing, we have:\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/a/5aa35708f2da543f9e19952c2a83cd54d1f6709f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+s^3+t^3 = (r^2+s^2+t^2)(r+s+t) - (rs+st+tr)(r+s+t)+3rst$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"570\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/20113245716ae8b29d49dff57a97153928cc778d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^4+s^4+t^4 = (r^3+s^3+t^3)(r+s+t) - (rs+st+tr)(r^2+s^2+t^2)-(rst)(r+s+t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"679\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9639bb6331e520207b8b4c34642e9db5fa3991ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^5+s^5+t^5 = (r^4+s^4+t^4)(r+s+t) - (rs+st+tr)(r^3+s^3+t^3) - (rst)(r^2+s^2+t^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"702\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\nClearly, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab13e8e9d051a35f8f03506af985e984719cd2b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-8+13 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"166\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-skibbysiggy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> be the roots of the polynomial. By definition, the following equations are true.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/4/d147a44c46eaee8ba9a40fe91eb6da7722cf81b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}     s_{k + 1} &amp;= \\alpha^{k + 1} + \\beta^{k + 1} + \\gamma^{k + 1} \\\\     s_k &amp;= \\alpha^k + \\beta^k + \\gamma^k \\\\     s_{k - 1} &amp;= \\alpha^{k - 1} + \\beta^{k - 1} + \\gamma^{k - 1} \\\\     s_{k - 2} &amp;= \\alpha^{k - 2} + \\beta^{k - 2} + \\gamma^{k - 2} \\end{align*}\" width=\"209\" height=\"104\" />\nThe equations could be used to find the relationships between the roots and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba141945ce0c59300026b7f27f716e335d5c16c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}     \\alpha^{k + 1} + \\beta^{k + 1} + \\gamma^{k + 1}     &amp;= a(\\alpha^k + \\beta^k + \\gamma^k) + b(\\alpha^{k - 1} + \\beta^{k - 1} + \\gamma^{k - 1}) + c(\\alpha^{k - 2} + \\beta^{k - 2} + \\gamma^{k - 2}) \\\\     &amp;= \\alpha^{k - 2}(c + b\\alpha + a\\alpha^2) + \\beta^{k - 2}(c + b\\beta + a\\beta^2) + \\gamma^{k - 2}(c + b\\gamma + a\\gamma^2) \\end{align*}\" width=\"696\" height=\"48\" />\nContinuing,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58dfdeb6207f4ff77ccf4944f8d236d55260f382.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\alpha^{k - 2}(\\alpha^3 - a\\alpha^2 - b\\alpha - c) + \\beta^{k - 2}(\\beta^3 - a\\beta^2 - b\\beta - c) + \\gamma^{k - 2}(\\gamma^3 - a\\gamma^2 - b\\gamma - c) = 0\\]\" width=\"559\" height=\"20\" />\nNotice that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b26df99af0811b2a07f0523fbbc8e2af2b1044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 - ax^2 - bx - c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />, the equation will satisfy. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72e2e58a2ef8bb4eedd627c212f63bb8f507301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 5$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/1604fe8788893e0e0b1e2d9cb6cc60beea7dca12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9fd57b20f51bc00b2c081b47d8c97981e082e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/c/5fcd24b7669a51957199562aa43500e6664e3862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"155\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MaPhyCom\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For those who want a video solution: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tAS_DbKmtzI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tAS_DbKmtzI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A\">2019 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017225532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 562/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 17803/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.587      1 -total\n 60.21%    7.579      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.06%    4.790      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17225:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017225532 and revision id 255702. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}